{"availability":"available","full":"PhiTux/DailyTxT","name":"DailyTxT","description":"Encrypted Diary Web-App","category":"Other","language":"Svelte","stars":507,"forks":42,"created":"2020-12-11T11:53:25Z","updated":"2026-10-04T09:35:01Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://hub.docker.com/r/phitux/dailytxt/","topics":[],"demo":"https://dailytxt.phitux.de/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-04T16:11:25.023Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-04T16:11:25.023Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-04T16:11:25.023Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-03T14:32:48.258Z","stars":505,"forks":42},{"at":"2026-10-04T16:11:25.023Z","stars":507,"forks":42}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["DailyTxT is an encrypted Diary/Journal WebApp with several features. It is written in Svelte and Go and meant to be run by Docker - supports AMD64 and ARM64.","🗣️🌍 You want to add new languages? See TRANSLATION.md for instructions.","When a user logs in, a key is derived from his password with Argon2id, it is called the derived key. The derived key is stored in a http-only cookie and send on every API-call. This key is used to decrypt the user's encryption key (which is randomly generated when the user is created). The encryption key is used to encrypt/decrypt all data of this user (entries and uploaded files) and never leaves the server."],"features":["Encryption: Everything you write is encrypted before it's written to the server's storage. Even the admin can't read your private stuff!","File-Upload: You can upload arbitrary files for each day (500 MB max each). They are stored encrypted on the server as well. Images are automatically recognized and added to the...","Image Viewer: View all images of a day in a gallery view and in full screen.","Markdown: You can write your entries in markdown and see a live preview.","Tags: You can add tags to your entries for better organization."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/PhiTux/DailyTxT/blob/main